    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghostmoons - Arcade, is a vehicle based first person shooter, focusing on last second rapid movement or strafing, to avoid projectiles and attacks. Your goal is to remove the unknown military's portals from the moons of the Ghostmoons system, while avoiding collateral damage of the native life forms. Navigate swarms of incoming rockets and machine gun fire, to engage military positions, if the native life forms aren't in the way. Unintentional casualties are unavoidable, but with a winning mission, and some windfall, the native life forms can be resurrected.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
